Playing Mac NetHack 3.0p7 I have once exceeded a 750K allocation.  The game
gave an out of memory error and exited.  I have no idea of how one could
restart the game (the levels files do stay around).  I now play with 1M.

About bags of holding:
It seems like you cannot take parts of collections out of bags.  I'm not
sure about this, but when trying to take things out of a bag (see below)
I could not take out '8 uncursed dilithium crystals' but on the next item,
I could take out 'one dilithium crystal'.
(No message like "you can only take out some of ..").

In the end (Usagi -S risen to demigod-hood), I think that you shouldn't have
to take things out of a bag in order to get credit for it.  (or that a
demigod can't carry it all :-).


